height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="YY0PIXX"><div data-content-type="text" data-appearance="default" data-element="main" data-pb-style="H8YUHS3"><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 24px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><strong><strong>HANOIA x PIERRE CHARRI&Eacute;</strong></strong></span></p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 22px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">B&#7896; S&#431;U T&#7852;P H&#7906;P T&Aacute;C GI&#7918;A S&#416;N M&Agrave;I VI&#7878;T V&Agrave; NH&Agrave; THI&#7870;T K&#7870; NG&#431;&#7900;I PH&Aacute;P</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-content-type="row" data-appearance="contained" data-element="main"><div data-enable-parallax="0" data-parallax-speed="0.5" data-background-images="{}" data-background-type="image" data-video-loop="true" data-video-play-only-visible="true" data-video-lazy-load="true" data-video-fallback-src="" data-element="inner" data-pb-style="Q516TSX"><figure data-content-type="image" data-appearance="full-width" data-element="main" data-pb-style="AEWKE0B"><img loading="lazy" height="100%" class="pagebuilder-mobile-hidden lazy" src="data&#x3A;image&#x2F;svg&#x2B;xml&#x3B;utf8,&lt;svg&#x20;xmlns&#x3D;&quot;http&#x3A;&#x2F;&#x2F;www.w3.org&#x2F;2000&#x2F;svg&quot;&#x20;viewBox&#x3D;&quot;0&#x20;0&#x20;1&#x20;1&quot;&#x20;width&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&#x20;height&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;svg&gt;" data-original="https://dytbw3ui6vsu6.cloudfront.net/media/wysiwyg/1_1789376597.webp" alt="" title="" data-element="desktop_image" data-pb-style="R03ONGK"><img loading="lazy" height="100%" class="pagebuilder-mobile-only lazy" src="data&#x3A;image&#x2F;svg&#x2B;xml&#x3B;utf8,&lt;svg&#x20;xmlns&#x3D;&quot;http&#x3A;&#x2F;&#x2F;www.w3.org&#x2F;2000&#x2F;svg&quot;&#x20;viewBox&#x3D;&quot;0&#x20;0&#x20;1&#x20;1&quot;&#x20;width&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&#x20;height&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;svg&gt;" data-original="https://dytbw3ui6vsu6.cloudfront.net/media/wysiwyg/1_1789376597.webp" alt="" title="" data-element="mobile_image" data-pb-style="J7GPI77"></figure><div class="pagebuilder-column-group" data-background-images="{}" data-content-type="column-group" data-appearance="default" data-grid-size="12" data-element="main" data-pb-style="ENSJI7A"><div class="pagebuilder-column-line" data-content-type="column-line" data-element="main" data-pb-style="RHBX6UE"><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="GATQANR"></div><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="HP42OG5"><div data-content-type="text" data-appearance="default" data-element="main" data-pb-style="QNJ07S6"><p dir="ltr">Ngh&#7879; thu&#7853;t s&#417;n m&agrave;i trong th&#7871; gi&#7899;i c&#7911;a Hanoia v&#7889;n kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; gi&#7899;i h&#7841;n, v&agrave; ranh gi&#7899;i &#7845;y c&agrave;ng r&#7897;ng m&#7903; khi g&#7863;p g&#7905; nh&#7919;ng t&#432; duy s&aacute;ng t&#7841;o kh&aacute;c bi&#7879;t. C&aacute;i b&#7855;t tay gi&#7919;a th&#432;&#417;ng hi&#7879;u th&#7911; c&ocirc;ng Vi&#7879;t c&ugrave;ng nh&agrave; thi&#7871;t k&#7871; ng&#432;&#7901;i Ph&aacute;p Pierre Charri&eacute; &#273;&atilde; bi&#7871;n nh&#7919;ng &yacute; ni&#7879;m ch&#432;a t&#7915;ng c&oacute; tr&#432;&#7899;c &#273;&acirc;y th&agrave;nh hi&#7879;n th&#7921;c.&nbsp;</p>
<p dir="ltr">Pierre Charri&eacute; l&agrave; ng&#432;&#7901;i ngh&#7879; s&#297; lu&ocirc;n t&igrave;m ki&#7871;m c&#7843;m h&#7913;ng b&#7857;ng c&aacute;ch s&#7917; d&#7909;ng gi&aacute;c quan &#273;&#7875; c&#7843;m nh&#7853;n v&#7841;n v&#7853;t. T&#7915; ch&#7845;t li&#7879;u, &acirc;m thanh cho &#273;&#7871;n nh&#7919;ng chuy&#7875;n &#273;&#7897;ng nh&#7887; nh&#7845;t trong cu&#7897;c s&#7889;ng &#273;&#7873;u c&oacute; th&#7875; tr&#7903; th&agrave;nh ngu&#7891;n c&#7897;i s&aacute;ng t&#7841;o. Ch&iacute;nh nh&#7919;ng rung c&#7843;m m&#7841;nh m&#7869; v&#7899;i th&#7871; gi&#7899;i b&ecirc;n ngo&agrave;i &#273;&atilde; nhen nh&oacute;m trong anh m&#7897;t c&aacute;i g&igrave; &#273;&oacute; th&#7853;t &#273;&#7865;p, &#273;&#7875; t&#7915; &#273;&oacute; v&ocirc; s&#7889; &yacute; t&#432;&#7903;ng &#273;&#432;&#7907;c kh&#417;i d&ograve;ng.&nbsp;</p>
<p dir="ltr">V&#7899;i vai tr&ograve; &#273;&#7891;ng s&aacute;ng t&#7841;o, Hanoia &#273;&atilde; c&ugrave;ng Pierre Charri&eacute; trao &#273;&#7893;i, tinh ch&#7881;nh &yacute; t&#432;&#7903;ng v&agrave; ph&aacute;t tri&#7875;n nh&#7919;ng k&#7929; thu&#7853;t ri&ecirc;ng &#273;&#7875; &#273;&#432;a ng&ocirc;n ng&#7919; s&#417;n m&agrave;i v&agrave;o t&#7915;ng thi&#7871;t k&#7871;. L&#7845;y c&#7843;m h&#7913;ng t&#7915; S&#7921; chuy&#7875;n h&oacute;a c&#7911;a s&#7921; s&#7889;ng, BST gieo v&agrave;o nh&#7919;ng c&#7843;m x&uacute;c m&#417; h&#7891; m&#7897;t h&igrave;nh h&agrave;i h&#7919;u h&igrave;nh, bi&#7871;n nh&#7919;ng g&igrave; ch&#7881; c&oacute; th&#7875; c&#7843;m nh&#7853;n th&agrave;nh t&aacute;c ph&#7849;m hi&#7879;n h&#7919;u ngay tr&#432;&#7899;c m&#7855;t.</p></div></div><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="Y73XHL2"></div></div></div></div></div><div data-content-type="row" data-appearance="contained" data-element="main"><div data-enable-parallax="0" data-parallax-speed="0.5" data-background-images="{}" data-background-type="image" data-video-loop="true" data-video-play-only-visible="true" data-video-lazy-load="true" data-video-fallback-src="" data-element="inner" data-pb-style="T9G5H2F"><div data-content-type="divider" data-appearance="default" data-element="main"><hr data-element="line" data-pb-style="O5JU8FR"></div></div></div><div data-content-type="row" data-appearance="contained" data-element="main"><div data-enable-parallax="0" data-parallax-speed="0.5" data-background-images="{}" data-background-type="image" data-video-loop="true" data-video-play-only-visible="true" data-video-lazy-load="true" data-video-fallback-src="" data-element="inner" data-pb-style="GQDJE95"><div data-content-type="text" data-appearance="default" data-element="main"><p id="V0604YO" style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><strong id="docs-internal-guid-e32e99a4-7fff-77de-5120-a08fc1d150f7">Vita</strong></span></p></div><div class="pagebuilder-column-group" data-background-images="{}" data-content-type="column-group" data-appearance="default" data-grid-size="12" data-element="main" data-pb-style="JKK2XJR"><div class="pagebuilder-column-line" data-content-type="column-line" data-element="main" data-pb-style="MF2AGON"><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="J7LQRU1"></div><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="SGBC1F4"><div data-content-type="text" data-appearance="default" data-element="main"><p style="text-align: center;">D&aacute;ng h&igrave;nh c&#7911;a Vita g&#7907;i li&ecirc;n t&#432;&#7903;ng &#273;&#7871;n m&#7897;t n&#7909; hoa &#273;ang ch&#7901; kho&#7843;nh kh&#7855;c bung n&#7903; th&agrave;nh &#273;&oacute;a hoa r&#7921;c r&#7905;. K&#7929; thu&#7853;t lan m&agrave;u &#273;&#432;&#7907;c ngh&#7879; nh&acirc;n x&#7917; l&yacute; tinh t&#7871;, v&#7899;i s&#7855;c &#273;&#7897; &#273;&#7853;m d&#7847;n &#7903; mi&#7879;ng b&igrave;nh r&#7891;i chuy&#7875;n nh&#7865; nh&agrave;ng xu&#7889;ng ph&#7847;n th&acirc;n b&ecirc;n d&#432;&#7899;i. S&#7921; chuy&#7875;n d&#7883;ch &#7845;y kh&ocirc;ng ch&#7881; t&#7841;o n&ecirc;n chi&#7873;u s&acirc;u cho m&agrave;u s&#7855;c m&agrave; c&ograve;n g&#7907;i c&#7843;m gi&aacute;c v&#7873; m&#7897;t th&#7921;c th&#7875; &#273;ang &acirc;m th&#7847;m thay &#273;&#7893;i t&#7915;ng ng&agrave;y.</p></div></div><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="RNKDJHM"></div></div><div class="pagebuilder-column-line" data-content-type="column-line" data-element="main" data-pb-style="OL9FL8B"><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="TKQACI2"><figure data-content-type="image" data-appearance="full-width" data-element="main" data-pb-style="OVHSC6B"><img loading="lazy" height="100%" class="pagebuilder-mobile-hidden lazy" src="data&#x3A;image&#x2F;svg&#x2B;xml&#x3B;utf8,&lt;svg&#x20;xmlns&#x3D;&quot;http&#x3A;&#x2F;&#x2F;www.w3.org&#x2F;2000&#x2F;svg&quot;&#x20;viewBox&#x3D;&quot;0&#x20;0&#x20;1&#x20;1&quot;&#x20;width&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&#x20;height&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;svg&gt;" data-original="https://dytbw3ui6vsu6.cloudfront.net/media/wysiwyg/2_1789376604.webp" alt="" title="" data-element="desktop_image" data-pb-style="MWG48DA"><img loading="lazy" height="100%" class="pagebuilder-mobile-only lazy" src="data&#x3A;image&#x2F;svg&#x2B;xml&#x3B;utf8,&lt;svg&#x20;xmlns&#x3D;&quot;http&#x3A;&#x2F;&#x2F;www.w3.org&#x2F;2000&#x2F;svg&quot;&#x20;viewBox&#x3D;&quot;0&#x20;0&#x20;1&#x20;1&quot;&#x20;width&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&#x20;height&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;svg&gt;" data-original="https://dytbw3ui6vsu6.cloudfront.net/media/wysiwyg/2_1789376604.webp" alt="" title="" data-element="mobile_image" data-pb-style="ME15DKD"></figure></div></div></div><div class="pagebuilder-column-group" data-background-images="{}" data-content-type="column-group" data-appearance="default" data-grid-size="12" data-element="main" data-pb-style="ES3UD1M"><div class="pagebuilder-column-line" data-content-type="column-line" data-element="main" data-pb-style="RPQW2QS"><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="HF5CFKW"><div data-content-type="text" data-appearance="default" data-element="main"><p style="text-align: center;">&#272;&uacute;ng nh&#432; t&ecirc;n g&#7885;i, Vita l&agrave; hi&#7879;n th&acirc;n c&#7911;a s&#7913;c s&#7889;ng m&atilde;nh li&#7879;t, n&#417;i d&ograve;ng ch&#7843;y n&#259;ng l&#432;&#7907;ng li&ecirc;n t&#7909;c tu&#7847;n ho&agrave;n v&agrave; sinh s&ocirc;i. &nbsp;</p></div></div></div></div><div data-content-type="products" data-appearance="carousel" data-autoplay="false" data-autoplay-speed="4000" data-infinite-loop="false" data-show-arrows="true" data-show-dots="false" data-carousel-mode="default" data-center-padding="90px" data-element="main" data-pb-style="BBCEMRM">        <ol class="product-items widget-product-grid" data-role="product-owlCarousel">
