;p ho&agrave;n h&#7843;o, b&#7903;i m&#7897;t sai l&#7879;ch nh&#7887; c&#361;ng c&oacute; th&#7875; l&agrave;m &#7843;nh h&#432;&#7903;ng &#273;&#7871;n c&#7845;u tr&uacute;c t&#7893;ng th&#7875;.</span></p></div></div><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="GV0TLGO"></div></div><div class="pagebuilder-column-line" data-content-type="column-line" data-element="main" data-pb-style="QORIY5E"><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="R0E11M6"><figure data-content-type="image" data-appearance="full-width" data-element="main" data-pb-style="RH25NS1"><img loading="lazy" height="100%" class="pagebuilder-mobile-hidden lazy" src="data&#x3A;image&#x2F;svg&#x2B;xml&#x3B;utf8,&lt;svg&#x20;xmlns&#x3D;&quot;http&#x3A;&#x2F;&#x2F;www.w3.org&#x2F;2000&#x2F;svg&quot;&#x20;viewBox&#x3D;&quot;0&#x20;0&#x20;1&#x20;1&quot;&#x20;width&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&#x20;height&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;svg&gt;" data-original="https://dytbw3ui6vsu6.cloudfront.net/media/wysiwyg/6_1789376629.webp" alt="" title="" data-element="desktop_image" data-pb-style="DVPSJMA"><img loading="lazy" height="100%" class="pagebuilder-mobile-only lazy" src="data&#x3A;image&#x2F;svg&#x2B;xml&#x3B;utf8,&lt;svg&#x20;xmlns&#x3D;&quot;http&#x3A;&#x2F;&#x2F;www.w3.org&#x2F;2000&#x2F;svg&quot;&#x20;viewBox&#x3D;&quot;0&#x20;0&#x20;1&#x20;1&quot;&#x20;width&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&#x20;height&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;svg&gt;" data-original="https://dytbw3ui6vsu6.cloudfront.net/media/wysiwyg/6_1789376629.webp" alt="" title="" data-element="mobile_image" data-pb-style="EUH6CMO"></figure></div></div></div><div class="pagebuilder-column-group" data-background-images="{}" data-content-type="column-group" data-appearance="default" data-grid-size="12" data-element="main" data-pb-style="XLWBY7Y"><div class="p