</div></div></div><div data-content-type="row" data-appearance="contained" data-element="main"><div class="product-recommended-title" data-enable-parallax="0" data-parallax-speed="0.5" data-background-images="{}" data-background-type="image" data-video-loop="true" data-video-play-only-visible="true" data-video-lazy-load="true" data-video-fallback-src="" data-element="inner" data-pb-style="CY4KKPX"><div data-content-type="divider" data-appearance="default" data-element="main"><hr data-element="line" data-pb-style="SRG73W8"></div><div data-content-type="text" data-appearance="default" data-element="main"><p dir="ltr" style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 18px;"><strong id="docs-internal-guid-fef61e52-7fff-82cb-a76e-738a0e4026d6">Bonbon</strong></span></p></div><div class="pagebuilder-column-group" data-background-images="{}" data-content-type="column-group" data-appearance="default" data-grid-size="12" data-element="main" data-pb-style="HU96QSI"><div class="pagebuilder-column-line" data-content-type="column-line" data-element="main" data-pb-style="DD1ETXR"><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="XGLGPOC"></div><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="H6MTOGH"><div data-content-type="text" data-appearance="default" data-element="main"><p style="text-align: center;">Bonbon g&#7907;i li&ecirc;n t&#432;&#7903;ng &#273;&#7871;n nh&#7919;ng vi&ecirc;n k&#7865;o m&#7873;m &#273;ang x&#7871;p ch&#7891;ng l&ecirc;n nhau. Thi&#7871;t k&#7871; &#7913;ng d&#7909;ng k&#7929; thu&#7853;t lan m&agrave;u m&#7873;m m&#7841;i, t&#7841;o hi&#7879;u &#7913;ng chuy&#7875;n m&agrave;u li&#7873;n m&#7841;ch tr&ecirc;n b&#7873; m&#7863;t s&#7843;n ph&#7849;m. B&ecirc;n c&#7841;nh v&#7867; &#273;&#7865;p th&#7883; gi&aacute;c, k&#7871;t c&#7845;u v&#7919;ng ch&#7855;c, &#7893;n &#273;&#7883;nh c&ugrave;ng tr&#7843;i nghi&#7879;m ng&#7891;i &ecirc;m &aacute;i, tho&#7843;i m&aacute;i gi&uacute;p chi&#7871;c gh&#7871; tr&#7903; th&agrave;nh m&#7897;t &#273;i&#7875;m nh&#7845;n &#273;&#7847;y &#7845;n t&#432;&#7907;ng cho kh&ocirc;ng gian.</p></div></div><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="BLT9DU0"></div></div><div class="pagebuilder-column-line" data-content-type="column-line" data-element="main" data-pb-style="Y0WIH1W"><div class="pagebuilder-column" data-content-type="column" data-appearance="full-height" data-background-images="{}" data-element="main" data-pb-style="PFMJTTK"><figure data-content-type="image" data-appearance="full-width" data-element="main" data-pb-style="QYLC347"><img loading="lazy" height="100%" class="pagebuilder-mobile-hidden lazy" src="data&#x3A;image&#x2F;svg&#x2B;xml&#x3B;utf8,&lt;svg&#x20;xmlns&#x3D;&quot;http&#x3A;&#x2F;&#x2F;www.w3.org&#x2F;2000&#x2F;svg&quot;&#x20;viewBox&#x3D;&quot;0&#x20;0&#x20;1&#x20;1&quot;&#x20;width&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&#x20;height&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;svg&gt;" data-original="https://dytbw3ui6vsu6.cloudfront.net/media/wysiwyg/8_1789376641.webp" alt="" title="" data-element="desktop_image" data-pb-style="LN26H3L"><img loading="lazy" height="100%" class="pagebuilder-mobile-only lazy" src="data&#x3A;image&#x2F;svg&#x2B;xml&#x3B;utf8,&lt;svg&#x20;xmlns&#x3D;&quot;http&#x3A;&#x2F;&#x2F;www.w3.org&#x2F;2000&#x2F;svg&quot;&#x20;viewBox&#x3D;&quot;0&#x20;0&#x20;1&#x20;1&quot;&#x20;width&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&#x20;height&#x3D;&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;svg&gt;" data-original="https://dytbw3ui6vsu6.cloudfront.net/media/wysiwyg/8_1789376641.webp" alt="" title="" data-element="mobile_image" data-pb-style="QQ07C84"></figure><div data-content-type="products" data-appearance="carousel" data-autoplay="false" data-autoplay-speed="4000" data-infinite-loop="false" data-s